## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior product architect, full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect, financial systems specialist and quality assurance engineer.

Your task is to design and build a complete, professional, production-oriented retail business management application called **RetailMate**.

Do not create a simple demonstration, static dashboard, landing-page-only website or non-functional UI prototype.

Build an actual working application with connected modules, persistent data, real business logic, authentication, inventory management, sales management, purchases, expenses, analytics and reporting.

Think like a team building a commercial SaaS product intended for thousands of small and medium-sized retail businesses.

The application must be exceptionally easy to use, visually sophisticated, reliable, responsive and practical for everyday business operations.

