# 2. PRODUCT VISION

RetailMate is an all-in-one digital business management platform for small retail businesses.

Its purpose is to replace scattered notebooks, manual calculations, spreadsheets and disconnected applications with one easy-to-use system.

The application should help business owners:

- Manage products and inventory.
- Record daily sales.
- Track purchases and suppliers.
- Record operating expenses.
- Monitor cash, UPI and other payment collections.
- Calculate business performance.
- Generate daily, weekly and monthly reports.
- Identify low-stock products.
- Understand which products are selling well.
- Make better purchasing decisions.
- Obtain AI-powered business insights.

